# --- Git LFS Configuration (Centralized) ---
# This is the centralized LFS tracking configuration for all projects.
# It is referenced by the git hooks (pre-commit, post-checkout) in setup/git-template/hooks/
# When this file is updated, all new projects cloned will automatically use the latest rules.

